                "id": "CF-0544800D8d000003VQwdEAG",
                "title": "FCP: Landscape Recovery Research Partnership",
                "description": "The Authority are looking for a collaborative research partnership with expertise across the environmental, social and economic challenges that face Landscape Recovery (LR).  \r\nThe partnership will tackle research at a scheme level through collaborative research-policy-practice partnerships. This will draw on the vast data that are already being collected by the LR projects as part of their Monitoring and Evaluation requirements and enable learning from the experiences of the varied stakeholders.\r\nThere is no competition for the research topic area expertise offered by The Leverhulme Centre for Nature Recovery (LCNR) at University of Oxford",
